                      "settings": {
                        "editor": "<div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:16px;padding:26px;margin-bottom:19px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;background:rgba(200,133,26,0.25);color:#F0C060;\">রা</div><div><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.2;\">Rajesh Dutta <span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;background:#C8851A;color:#fff;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px;margin-left:4px;\">NRI</span></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);margin-top:1px;\">🇸🇬 Singapore — books for parents in Mandirtala</div></div></div><div style=\"color:#F0C060;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:8px;\">★★★★★</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);line-height:1.8;font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);line-height:0;vertical-align:-0.4rem;margin-right:3px;\">\"</span>From Singapore I book for my 78-year-old mother. Dr. Ghosh speaks Bengali, explains slowly, and every week I get a WhatsApp video of Ma saying she's well. For the first time in 3 years, I sleep without worry.</div></div>"
